<title>USA: Citizens First gets nod to buy shares.</title>
<headline>Citizens First gets nod to buy shares.</headline>
<dateline>NORMAL, Ill. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens First Financial Corp said Thursday the Office of Thrift Supervision approved the company's plan to purchase 10 percent of its issued and outstanding common stock, or 281,750 shares.</p>
<p>Citizens First is the holding company for Citizens Savings Bank FSB, which had assets of $266.4 million as of September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
